    (i) to prohibit the person from applying to be licensed for a period or until the occurrence of an event that the Authority specifies;
    (ii) to prohibit the person from being appointed as a responsible officer for a period or until the occurrence of an event that the Authority specifies;
  (d) for a person who is or was a regulated person—to reprimand the person publicly or privately;
